#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:811
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two options for changing the time: Edit Absolute, in which the "
"session and total times can be changed separately; and Edit Relative, in "
"which a certain change is added to or subtracted from both the session and "
"total times."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:814
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Auto tracking option allows timing to start and stop automatically when "
"you switch to or from a particular &kde; desktop."
msgstr ""

