#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Opens</action> a dialog to allow the user to configure &karm;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:849
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The dialog has three tabbed panes: <guilabel>Behavior </guilabel>, which "
"allows you to specify an alert for no activity and a warning message when "
"you delete a task set, <guilabel>Display </guilabel>, which configures the "
"fields shown in the main window and <guilabel>Storage</guilabel>, which "
"configures the location of the save file, whether auto saving is enabled and "
"the auto save interval."
msgstr ""

